whalepi (0.9.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging of the WhalePi installer.
  * Installs prerequisites, downloads the PAMGuard firmware (v0.9.0) and
    configures the Raspberry Pi Zero.
  * Prompts (via debconf) for a short system name and writes it to the
    WhalePiDog settings (bluetoothSettings.identification and recordingPrefix).

